{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>HUSHRUN</strong> \u2014 an asymmetric multiplayer horror game. An abandoned city, the dead of night, and zombies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A group of survivors finds themselves trapped in a mysterious ghost town. The goal is simple \u2014 survive until dawn. Hide in the shadows, take cover inside abandoned buildings, and don't make a sound.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But as dawn approaches, the danger grows. Zombies sense your fear and begin to see in the dark. Panic is your worst enemy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playing as the infected, you are the hunter. Search every building, sweep through dark alleyways. By the end of the round, the advantage is completely yours. But remember \u2014 adrenaline makes survivors faster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Who will live to see the dawn?</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3994540?t=1774699634","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3994540?t=1774699634","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994540/0bfe6f85cf16b08de71156cd4be6a5a107f4994b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774699634","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994540/0bfe6f85cf16b08de71156cd4be6a5a107f4994b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774699634","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description"